---
// MeasurementSection.astro - Section 10: Wavefunction Collapse & Physical Measurement
---

<section class="landing-section measurement-section" id="sectionMeasurement">
  <div class="section-header-block">
    <div class="section-tag">
      <span class="tag-number">05</span>
      <span class="tag-label">WAVEFUNCTION COLLAPSE</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-main-heading">
      MEASUREMENT: <span class="text-emerald-glow">PROJECTION</span>.
    </h2>
    <p class="section-sub-heading">
      "Possibility becomes definite outcome. Observation forces the quantum system into classical reality."
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="measurement-display-card glass-panel" id="measResultBox">
    <div class="collapse-sim-header">
      <div class="sim-pulse-ring" id="measPulseIndicator"></div>
      <div class="sim-status-title">BORN-RULE STATE PROJECTION</div>
    </div>

    <div class="collapse-sequence-grid">
      <!-- State Before Measurement -->
      <div class="collapse-state-col">
        <span class="collapse-col-label">BEFORE MEASUREMENT</span>
        <div class="prob-spectrum-box">
          <div class="spectrum-row">
            <span class="spectrum-state">|0⟩</span>
            <div class="spectrum-track"><div class="spectrum-fill fill-cyan" style="width: 73%;"></div></div>
            <span class="spectrum-val">73%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spectrum-row">
            <span class="spectrum-state">|1⟩</span>
            <div class="spectrum-track"><div class="spectrum-fill fill-magenta" style="width: 27%;"></div></div>
            <span class="spectrum-val">27%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="collapse-col-caption">Continuous probabilistic superposition |ψ⟩ = 0.854|0⟩ + 0.520|1⟩.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Measurement Event Pulse -->
      <div class="collapse-action-col">
        <div class="meas-symbol-icon">⚡ M</div>
        <span class="meas-action-text">PROJECTION OPERATOR</span>
      </div>

      <!-- State After Collapse -->
      <div class="collapse-state-col">
        <span class="collapse-col-label">AFTER MEASUREMENT</span>
        <div class="collapsed-eigenstate-box" id="measOutcomeVal">
          <span class="eigenstate-badge">COLLAPSED</span>
          <span class="eigenstate-val">|0⟩</span>
          <span class="eigenstate-prob">P(|0⟩) = 100.0%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="collapse-col-caption">Statevector instantly collapsed into classical basis eigenvalue.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Educational Footer Note -->
    <div class="collapse-notes-footer">
      <div class="note-item">
        <span class="note-bullet">◈</span>
        <span>Measurement consumes quantum energy budget and permanently freezes qubit until new unitary gates are applied.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .measurement-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 24px;
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .text-emerald-glow {
    color: var(--quantum-emerald);
    text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.4);
  }

  .measurement-display-card {
    padding: 40px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    transition: all 0.4s ease;
  }

  .collapse-sim-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .sim-pulse-ring {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--quantum-emerald);
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--quantum-emerald);
  }

  .sim-status-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .collapse-sequence-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.6fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .collapse-state-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .collapse-col-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .prob-spectrum-box {
    background: rgba(10, 16, 26, 0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .spectrum-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .spectrum-state {
    color: #f1f5f9;
    font-weight: 700;
    width: 24px;
  }

  .spectrum-track {
    flex: 1;
    height: 6px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .spectrum-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .fill-cyan {
    background: var(--quantum-cyan);
  }

  .fill-magenta {
    background: #c77dff;
  }

  .spectrum-val {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-weight: 600;
    width: 32px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .collapse-col-caption {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .collapse-action-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .meas-symbol-icon {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--quantum-emerald);
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.8);
  }

  .meas-action-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .collapsed-eigenstate-box {
    background: rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid var(--quantum-emerald);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.15);
  }

  .eigenstate-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--quantum-emerald);
  }

  .eigenstate-val {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.8);
  }

  .eigenstate-prob {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--quantum-emerald);
  }

  .collapse-notes-footer {
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .note-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .note-bullet {
    color: var(--quantum-emerald);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .collapse-sequence-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
